This crate (`symphonia-bundle-tta`) is a pure-Rust demuxer and decoder for True Audio (TTA1)
streams. The bitstream parsing and the decoding algorithm are a port of the TTA support in FFmpeg
(release n9.0.2, https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg):

  libavcodec/tta.c       (frame decoding: adaptive Rice code, hybrid filter calls, fixed order
                          prediction, channel decorrelation, end of last frame detection)
  libavcodec/ttadsp.c    (the 8-tap sign-sign LMS hybrid filter)
  libavcodec/ttadata.c   (the Rice parameter threshold table and the filter configuration)
  libavformat/tta.c      (the file header, seek table, packet and seek layout)
  libavformat/matroskadec.c (the header that is synthesized for `A_TTA1` Matroska tracks)

