The True Audio format and its reference implementation (libtta) are by Aleksander Djuric
(https://www.true-audio.com/). No code of libtta was used.

FFmpeg itself was used, unmodified and unlinked, as the decode oracle (and its `tta` encoder as the
stream generator) to verify that this decoder's output is bit-exact.
